 217	/// Read the current contents of the framebuffer into CPU memory.
 218	///
 219	/// This is used by the CPU readback presentation fallback. The
 220	/// returned data is tightly-packed RGBA8 with premultiplied alpha,
 221	/// i.e. `width * 4` bytes per row, containing sRGB-encoded values:
